From ba1fdbf28fbd2f4acf6c8544ace782d917bbb7c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel Zwerschke <pavel.zwerschke@quantco.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:33:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] x264, ffmpeg: link the libraries the build prefix
 installs

conda-forge packages x264 and FFmpeg (the same 9.0.2) as shared libraries
and does not vendor them into other packages. The engine's crates only
reach either through their C shims over the public APIs, so compile those
shims against the prefix's headers and link its libx264, libavformat,
libavcodec, libswresample and libavutil, instead of fetching and building
x264, NASM, FFmpeg and libopus from source.
---
